{"kind": "mod", "id": 766, "name": "No Grenade ESP", "slug": "no-grenade-esp", "teaser": "Tired of AI Always outrunning grenades you throw?  This forces them to be locked into place by chance percentage.", "owner_name": "Props", "downloads": 38381, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:43.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-02-20T21:28:06.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-02-20T21:28:06.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.9.0", "latest_version": "1.7.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<ol>\n<li>Patched ShallRunAway methods so that there is a percentage chance to not run away based on what the value is set to in the bepinex config menu. Default is 35 percent so they will not run away when they see a grenade .</li>\n<li>It may look janky sometimes because they try to run but got stopped :).</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Installation</p>\n<p>-Unzip into your bepinex/plugins folder.</p>\n<p>If you guys enjoy my work and feel like buying me caffeine, here’s my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/T6T7QSN01\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">kofi.</a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.6.1", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.1", "content_length": null, "downloads": 6478, "published_at": "2023-10-20T17:53:39.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/766/no-grenade-esp/1.6.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.6.2", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 5290, "published_at": "2024-04-10T00:37:19.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/766/no-grenade-esp/1.6.2", "github_url": null, "external_ur